    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Genevieve Leclair, conductor\nKerry DuWors, violin\nLindsay Knight, spoken word\n\nThe [Uncertain] Four Seasons is an algorithmic re-composition of Vivaldi’s ‘The Four Seasons’. Developed by composers, musicians, climate and computer scientists using geospatial climate predictions for 2050.\n\nDip into the music you know and love and experience it changed to reflect our very own Saskatoon climate thirty years from …"
      }
