        "@id": "https://saskatoonsymphony.org/event/czech-romance/"
      }
    ],
    "https://schema.org/text": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\t\t\t\n\n\n2:00PM, Sunday, February 16, 2020\nConvocation Hall\n\n\n107 Administration Place\nSaskatoon, Saskatchewan S7N 5A2\nGoogle Maps Directions\n\n\nBuy Tickets\n\n\n\nSaskatoon Symphony Chamber Ensemble\n \nThe music of Czech composers has a trademark romantic feel. Lush sounds with beautiful sweeping melodies will fill Convocation Hall as the Chamber Ensemble present this Valentine’s weekend concert featuring the music of Dvorak and Foerster.\n \nCypresses – Dvořák\nWind Quintet Op 95 – Foerster\n\nThe SSO’s Sunday Chamber Series is across the river to historic Convocation Hall.  Street parking and some parking lots are free on campus on Sundays. We encourage all concert goers to bring their favourite coffee in a travel mug.\n\n\n\t\t"
      }
    ]
  },
