        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Meagan&amp;Amy"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Amy Hillis, violin\nMeagan Milatz, piano\n\nIn search for a musical identity that embraces all of Canada, the duo meagan&amp;amy presents connections between Canadian music and the traditional canon of classical repertoire. Selected as winners of the \"Road Trip! A Pan- Canadian Partnership\" recital tour offered by Debut Atlantic, Jeunesses Musicales Canada, and Prairie Debut, the duo …"
      }
    ],
