        "@value": "Home for the Holidays"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This is the not to be missed concert of the holidays!\n\nSaskatoon's vocal talent put on a benefit concert for Saskatoon Opera while they're \"home for the holidays\".\n\nThere's an incredible assortment of music from 12 operatic voices, showcasing some of the best loved opera hits!"
      }
    ],
