    ],
    "https://schema.org/text": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\t\t\t\n\n\n7:00PM, Tuesday, October 6, 2020\nSaskatoon Symphony Orchestra\n\n\n602 B 51st Street\nSaskatoon, Saskatchewan S7K 7K3\nGoogle Maps Directions\n\n\nfrom Free\nJoin Live Stream\n\n\n\nJoin us as we dig in to the details of our completely reimagined season!\nEach Tuesday before a concert we’ll bring you an in-depth discussion with Music Director Eric Paetkau, ED Mark Turner, guest conductors, musicians, and guests – find out how the programming was put together, the challenges of rebuilding a season from scratch, and insightful knowledge behind the music of our concerts!\n \nThese events are streamed for free on our Digital Concert Stream all year long. We’d love to have you ask questions too, so be sure to add them to the chat!\n\n\n\t\t"
      }
    ]
  },
