      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&nbsp;\n\nMartin MacDonald, conductor\nAccent\n\nThis concert is made possible thanks to the generosity of Dr. Anne Neufeld.\n\nWe're thrilled to finally have Accent joining us on stage - after waiting two years since we had to cancel their performance due to the pandemic.\n\nThis concert is special as Accent is doing their first full orchestral Pops show in the …"
