    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Tania Miller, conductor\nJane Coop, piano\n\n&nbsp;\n\nMaestra Tania Miller returns home to Saskatchewan to lead the SSO in this energetic spring concert featuring Tchaikovsky's iconic and sweeping Symphony No 5 - paired poignantly alongside Pyotr's Dream by Canadian composer Andrew Balfour. Tchaikovsky's life was one of constant inner turmoil; with his personal life silenced by society, Tchaikovksy's …"
