    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "And Tomorrow"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Conductor Nicolas Ellis and soprano Danika Loren join the SSO for Strauss' stunning Opus 27."
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/eventStatus": [
      {
        "@id": "http://schema.org/EventScheduled"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://www.saskatoonsymphony.org/temporary/8e273130-fd66-42cc-ba20-912da99c50d7",
    "@type": [
      "https://schema.org/Blog"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://saskatoonsymphony.org/event/and-tomorrow/"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://www.saskatoonsymphony.org/temporary/235da262-149d-4a63-8cf2-6c8a56b5cc21",
    "@type": [
      "https://schema.org/CreativeWork"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://saskatoonsymphony.org/event/and-tomorrow/"
      }
    ],
    "https://schema.org/text": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\t\t\t\n\n\n7:30PM, Saturday, May 6, 2023\nTCU Place, Sid Buckwold Theatre\n\n\n35 – 22nd Street East\nSaskatoon, SK S7K 0C8\nGoogle Maps Directions\n\n\nBuy Your Tickets\n\n\n\nLive stream this performance on ConcertStream.tv\n\nNicolas Ellis, conductor\nDanika Lorèn, soprano\nLes Préludes, S. 97 – Franz Liszt\nFour Lieder, Op. 27 – Richard Strauss\nPetite Suite pour Orchestre – Germaine Tailleferre\nFirebird Suite – Igor Stravinsky\n\nScroll down to read the full program or click here to download the print-at-home version.\nRenewal | Passion | Rapture\n\n…the sun will shine again. Experience the rapturous beauty of Strauss’ Opus 27 song cycle and Stravinsky’s passionate Firebird. Conductor Nicolas Ellis returns to lead the SSO in what promises to be a moving performance in collaboration with soprano Danika Lorèn. \n \nLive stream this performance on ConcertStream.tv\n\nA digital ticket gives you 24-hour access to the stream for $19.99\nSupporter tickets can be purchased for $35 and $50\nSSO Streaming Subscription gives you unlimited access to live streams and concert films on demand\nSupport your orchestra by donating today!\n\n\nThe Program\nAnd Tomorrow…\nNicolas Ellis, conductor\nDanika Lorèn, soprano\nSaskatoon Symphony Orchestra\n\n \nLes Préludes, S. 97\nFranz Liszt\nVier Lieder, Op. 27\nI. Ruhe, meine Seele! (“Rest, my Soul!”)\nII. Cäcilie\nIII. Heimliche Aufforderung (“The Lover’s Pledge”)\nIV. Morgen! (“Tomorrow”)\n\nRichard Strauss\n~Intermission~\nPetite Suite: Pour Petit Orchestre\nI. Prélude\nII. Les filles de La Rochelle\nGermaine Tailleferre\nThe Firebird Suite (1919)\nI. Introduction\nII. Prelude and Dance of the FirebirdIII. Variations (Firebird)\nIV. Rondo (Chorovod)\nV. Infernal Dance\nVI. Lullaby (Berceuse)\nVII. Final Hymn\n\nIgor Stravinsky\nThe Artists\n[wp_show_posts id=”12299″]\nClick here to read about your Orchestra!\nThis concert also includes:\n\nViolin 1: Brandon Johnson, Monica Martin, Evan Friesen\nViolin 2: Alexa Arnyek\nViola: Heather Wilson\nBass: Cameron Breiter\nFlute: Rowan Froh\nOboe: Glenda Lindgren\nClarinet: Alyssa Thompson\nHorn: Stacey Mortenson-Spokes\nPercussion: Andra Wist\nKeyboard: Naomi Piggot-Suchan\nHarp: Christina Kant\n\nClick here to learn more about our Partners.\n\nProgram Notes\n[wp_show_posts id=”12298″]\nWhat’s Next\n\nA Change is Gonna Come7:30PM Sat, Apr 11, 2026Save Your SeatsAfter Dark8:00PM Sat, Apr 18, 2026Save Your SeatsThe Traveller7:30PM Sat, May 02, 2026Save Your SeatsJames Ehnes in Recital7:30PM Wed, May 06, 2026Save Your SeatsMothers' Day2:00PM Sun, May 10, 2026FREE EVENTFinding Light7:30PM Sat, May 30, 2026Save Your SeatsCroon8:00PM Mon, Jul 06, 2026Save Your SeatsHarry Potter and the Goblet of Fire™ in Concert1:30PM Sat, Oct 10, 2026Save Your Seats7:30PM Sat, Oct 10, 2026Save Your Seats\n\n\n\n\t\t"
      }
    ]
  },
