    "https://schema.org/text": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\t\t\t\n\n\n7:30PM, Saturday, September 24, 2022\nTCU Place, Sid Buckwold Theatre\n\n\n35 – 22nd Street East\nSaskatoon, SK S7K 0C8\nGoogle Maps Directions\n\n\nBuy your Tickets\n\n\n\nLive stream this performance on ConcertStream.tv\nJudith Yan, conductor\nRyan Davis, viola\nAllison Miller, flute\n\nUp to Her Waist in Lupins – Christos Hatzis*\nViola Concerto in G minor – Cecil Forsyth\nSymphony No. 2, Op. 30 – Ruth Gipps\nExcitement | Curiosity | Joy\nAn epic musical adventure of discovery that you must experience live.\nMaestra Judith Yan leads your orchestra in our new commission by composer Christos Hatzis in honour of our flute emeritus, Randi Nelson. This world premiere features our very own Principal Flute Allison Miller showcasing her exceptional artistry in this new work by the world-renowned Hatzis.\nSaskatoon’s own Ryan Davis returns home to make his SSO debut with his very favourite piece of music, Cecil Forsyth’s Viola Concerto. Never heard of it? Trust us you’re going to wonder why you’ve been missing out!\nThe real adventure begins when we dive into the cinematic soundscape of Ruth Gipps’ 2nd Symphony. Gipps captures lightning in a bottle with this one-movement work that acts as an affair with your imagination. \nWe’re certain that no one in the room will have heard this music performed before…forget what you know and jump in with both feet.\n Scroll down to read the full program. You can download the print-at-home version here.\n*Denotes Canadian Composer\nLive stream this performance on ConcertStream.tv\n\nA digital ticket gives you 24-hour access to the stream for $19.99\nSupporter tickets can be purchased for $35 and $50\nSSO Streaming Subscription gives you unlimited access to live streams and concert films on demand\nSupport your orchestra by donating today!\n\nThe Program\nOrchestration\nSense of Adventure\nJudith Yan, conductor\nRyan Davis, viola\nAllison Miller, flute\nSaskatoon Symphony Orchestra\nUp to Her Waist in Lupins\nChristos Hatzis\nViola Concerto in G Minor\nI. Appassionato (Cadenza) – Moderato –\nCon moto, agitato\nII. Andante un poco sostenuto\nIII. Allegro con fuoco\nCecil Forsyth\n~Intermission~\nSymphony No. 2 in B Major, Op.30 \nI. Moderato\nII. Allegro moderato – Poco meno\nIII. Andante – Maestoso\nIV. Tempo di marcia\nV. Adagio\nVI. Allegro moderato – Tranquillo\nVII. Moderato – Appassionato\nVIII. Allegro – Più mosso\nRuth Gipps\nThe Artists\n[wp_show_posts id=”11705″]\nClick here to read about your Orchestra!\nThis concert also includes:\nViolin 1 – Evan Friesen, Lauren Dykstra\nViolin 2 – Brandon Johnson, Alexa Arnyek\nCello – Hans Deason\nHarp – Keri Zwicker\nFlute – Jennifer McAllister\nHorn – Erin McVittie, Roxanne Inch\nPercussion – Andra Wist\nPiano – Michelle Aalders\n\nClick here to learn more about our Partners.\nProgram Notes\n[wp_show_posts id=”11716″]\n\n\n\t\t"
      }
    ]
  },
