    "https://schema.org/text": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\t\t\t\n\n\n7:30PM, Saturday, January 21, 2023\nTCU Place, Sid Buckwold Theatre\n\n\n35 – 22nd Street East\nSaskatoon, SK S7K 0C8\nGoogle Maps Directions\n\n\nSold Out\n\n\n\nJanna Sailor, conductor\nJeans n’ Classics\n\nFun | Nostalgia | Desbundar (to shed one’s inhibitions in having fun)\nScroll down to read the full program.\nWe have a dream, and knowing you we think you have it too! It’s all your favourite ABBA hits in one great concert. We hope you’ll take a chance on this concert and party the night away with Jeans n’ Classics.\nSupport your orchestra by donating today!\n\n\nThe Program\nDancing Queen – The Music of ABBA\nJanna Sailor, conductor\nJeans n’ Classics\nMamma Mia\nBenny Andersson, Björn Ulvaeus & Stig Anderson\narr. Peter Brennan\nKnowing Me Knowing You\nBenny Andersson, Björn Ulvaeus & Stig Anderson\narr. Peter Brennan\nI Do, I Do, I Do\nBenny Andersson, Björn Ulvaeus & Stig Anderson\narr. Peter Brennan\nDoes Your Mother Know\nBenny Andersson & Björn Ulvaeus\narr. Peter Brennan\nChiquitita\nBenny Andersson & Björn Ulvaeus\narr. Peter Brennan\nWaterloo\nBenny Andersson, Björn Ulvaeus & Stig Anderson\narr. Peter Brennan\nSOS\nBenny Andersson, Björn Ulvaeus & Stig Anderson\narr. Peter Brennan\nFernando\nBenny Andersson, Björn Ulvaeus & Stig Anderson\narr. Peter Brennan\nSuper Trouper\nBenny Andersson & Björn Ulvaeus\narr. Peter Brennan\n~Intermission~\nVoulez Vous\nBenny Andersson & Björn Ulvaeus\narr. Peter Brennan\nSummer Night City\nBenny Andersson & Björn Ulvaeus\narr. Peter Brennan\nLay All Your Love On Me\nBenny Andersson & Björn Ulvaeus\narr. Peter Brennan\nI Have A Dream\nBenny Andersson & Björn Ulvaeus\narr. Peter Brennan\nMoney, Money, Money\nBenny Andersson & Björn Ulvaeus\narr. Peter Brennan\nThe Winner Takes It All\nBenny Andersson & Björn Ulvaeus\narr. Peter Brennan\nTake a Chance on Me\nBenny Andersson & Björn Ulvaeus\narr. Peter Brennan\nGimme! Gimme! Gimme!\nBenny Andersson & Björn Ulvaeus\narr. Peter Brennan\n \nThe Artists\n[wp_show_posts id=”11958″]\nClick here to read about your Orchestra!\nClick here to learn more about our Partners.\nProgram Notes\n[wp_show_posts id=”11977″]\nWhat’s Next\nA Change is Gonna Come7:30PM Sat, Apr 11, 2026Save Your SeatsAfter Dark8:00PM Sat, Apr 18, 2026Save Your SeatsThe Traveller7:30PM Sat, May 02, 2026Save Your SeatsJames Ehnes in Recital7:30PM Wed, May 06, 2026Save Your SeatsMothers' Day2:00PM Sun, May 10, 2026FREE EVENTFinding Light7:30PM Sat, May 30, 2026Save Your SeatsCroon8:00PM Mon, Jul 06, 2026Save Your SeatsHarry Potter and the Goblet of Fire™ in Concert1:30PM Sat, Oct 10, 2026Save Your Seats7:30PM Sat, Oct 10, 2026Save Your Seats\n\n\n\t\t"
