      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://www.saskatoonsymphony.org/temporary/a3b5393e-828a-4bb2-ba23-0d999116d7fb",
    "@type": [
      "https://schema.org/Blog"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://saskatoonsymphony.org/event/halloween-bash/"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://www.saskatoonsymphony.org/temporary/2ddb88fd-5c04-4f1c-8876-1bc0bd444553",
    "@type": [
      "https://schema.org/CreativeWork"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://saskatoonsymphony.org/event/halloween-bash/"
      }
    ],
    "https://schema.org/text": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\t\t\t\n\n\n7:30PM, Saturday, October 29, 2022\nTCU Place, Sid Buckwold Theatre\n\n\n35 – 22nd Street East\nSaskatoon, SK S7K 0C8\nGoogle Maps Directions\n\n\nBuy Your Tickets\n\n\n\nLive stream this performance on ConcertStream.tv\nArmand Birk, conductor\nIona Whipp, narrator\nKevin Power, narrator\nFun | Spooky | Haunting\nIt’s time for a spooktacular concert with the SSO! There are many treats, and a few tricks, in store for you this Halloween. Get ready to do the Danse Macabre, the Monster Mash, and enjoy the thrill of the night.\nDon’t forget to wear your best spooky outfit! There’s a costume contest in the lobby from 6:30 – 7:30 and at intermission hosted by Maygen Kardash of Sneakers & Lipstick.\nScroll down to read the full program. You can download the print-at-home version here.\nLive stream this performance on ConcertStream.tv\n\nA digital ticket gives you 24-hour access to the stream for $19.99\nSupporter tickets can be purchased for $35 and $50\nSSO Streaming Subscription gives you unlimited access to live streams and concert films on demand\nSupport your orchestra by donating today!\n\nThe Program\nHalloween Bash\nArmand Birk, conductor\nIona Whipp, narrator\nKevin Power, narrator\nSaskatoon Symphony Orchestra\nChamber Symphony, Op. 110a\n\n Allegro molto\n\nDmitri Shostakovich\nThriller\nRod Temperton\nAttrib. Michael Jackson\nArr. Larry Moore\nDanse Macabre, Op. 40\nCamille Saint-Saëns\nMonster Mash\nBobby Pickett and Leonard Capizzi\nArr. Bob Phillips\nNight on Bald Mountain\nModest Mussorgsky\nOrch. Nicolai Rimsky-Korsakov\n~Intermission~\nNhanderú\nClarice Assad\nThe Complete Harry Potter: Themes from all eight movies\nJohn Williams, Patrick Doyle, Nicholas Hooper, and Alexandre Desplat\nArr. Jerry Brubaker\nSymphonie Fantastique\n\n Dream of a Witches’ Sabbath\n\nHector Berlioz\nThe Artists\n[wp_show_posts id=”11814″]\nClick here to read about your Orchestra!\nThis concert also includes:\n\nViolin 1 – Kim de Laforest, Nova Wong\nFlute – Jennifer McAllister\nClarinet – Alyssa Thompson\nBassoon – Sandy Wilson\nHorn – Erin McVittie, Samuel Dmyterko\nTrumpet – Dean McNeill\nPercussion – Andra Wist\nPiano – Michelle Aalders\nHarp – Keri Zwicker\n\n\nClick here to learn more about our Partners.\nProgram Notes\n[wp_show_posts id=”11811″]\nWhat’s Next\nA Change is Gonna Come7:30PM Sat, Apr 11, 2026Save Your SeatsAfter Dark8:00PM Sat, Apr 18, 2026Save Your SeatsThe Traveller7:30PM Sat, May 02, 2026Save Your SeatsJames Ehnes in Recital7:30PM Wed, May 06, 2026Save Your SeatsMothers' Day2:00PM Sun, May 10, 2026FREE EVENTFinding Light7:30PM Sat, May 30, 2026Save Your SeatsCroon8:00PM Mon, Jul 06, 2026Save Your SeatsHarry Potter and the Goblet of Fire™ in Concert1:30PM Sat, Oct 10, 2026Save Your Seats7:30PM Sat, Oct 10, 2026Save Your Seats\n\n\n\t\t"
      }
    ]
  },
