    "https://schema.org/text": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\t\t\t\n\n\n7:30PM, Thursday, October 20, 2022\nVic Juba Theatre\n\n\n2602 59 Ave\nLloydminster, Alberta T9V 3N7\nGoogle Maps Directions\n\n\nBuy Tickets – Vic Juba\n\n\n7:30PM, Friday, October 21, 2022\nDekker Centre for the Performing Arts – North Battleford\n\n\n623 Carlton Trail\nNorth Battleford, SK\nGoogle Maps Directions\n\n\nBuy Tickets – Dekker Centre\n\n\n2:00PM, Saturday, October 22, 2022\nThe Roxy Theatre\n\n\n320 20th Street West\nSaskatoon, SK S7M 0X2\nGoogle Maps Directions\n\n\nBuy Tickets – Roxy Theatre\n\n\n7:30PM, Saturday, October 22, 2022\nThe Roxy Theatre\n\n\n320 20th Street West\nSaskatoon, SK S7M 0X2\nGoogle Maps Directions\n\n\nBuy Tickets – Roxy Theatre\n\n\n2:00PM, Sunday, October 23, 2022\nKerry Vickar Centre\n\n\n206 Bemister Ave E\nMelfort, SK S0E 1A0\nGoogle Maps Directions\n\n\nCall (306) 752-4177 to purchase tickets\n\n\n\nNosferatu with the SSO\nA Silent Film Tour\n \nThe Saskatoon Symphony Orchestra takes you back to the days of silent film to celebrate the 100th anniversary of one of the great horror movies of the era! Nosferatu was steeped in mystery and quickly became one of the most important movies of the 20th century – now you can experience it with music performed live by the SSO.\n\nNosferatu – A Symphony of Horror\nFeaturing the music of Johannes Brahms\nArrangements and incidental music by Peter B. Kay\nWith bonus feature\nFelix the Cat in Pedigreedy\nMusic by Ben Model\nwww.silentfilmmusic.com\nArranged by Nick Stephens\nThe Artists\nBrian Unverricht, conductor\nviolin 1 – Michael Swan\nviolin 2 – Oxana Ossiptchouk\nviola – Jim Legge & Sarah ter Velde\ncello – John Payzant\nbass – Chantel Leung\npiano – Deborah Buck\nClick here to read about your Orchestra!\n\nThe Friday evening performance in North Battleford is sponsored by \n\nClick here to learn more about our Partners.\nProgram Notes\n \nWhat’s Next\nA Change is Gonna Come7:30PM Sat, Apr 11, 2026Save Your SeatsAfter Dark8:00PM Sat, Apr 18, 2026Save Your SeatsThe Traveller7:30PM Sat, May 02, 2026Save Your SeatsJames Ehnes in Recital7:30PM Wed, May 06, 2026Save Your SeatsMothers' Day2:00PM Sun, May 10, 2026FREE EVENTFinding Light7:30PM Sat, May 30, 2026Save Your SeatsCroon8:00PM Mon, Jul 06, 2026Save Your SeatsHarry Potter and the Goblet of Fire™ in Concert1:30PM Sat, Oct 10, 2026Save Your Seats7:30PM Sat, Oct 10, 2026Save Your Seats\n\n\n\t\t"
      }
    ]
  },
