    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Scroll down to read the full program, or click here for the print-at-home version.\n\nJoin the Fireside Singers and the Saskatoon Symphony Orchestra as they collaborate to offer their audience an entertaining evening of the most powerful choral Broadway Showstoppers! The concert will showcase engaging solos, ensembles, and overtures from your favourite Broadway musicals. This exciting …"
