        "@value": "Harry Potter and the Philosopher's Stone™ in Concert"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Relive the film that started it all. Watch the wand choose the wizard, a troll run amok and magic mirrors in high-definition while a live orchestra performs John Williams’ iconic score. Don’t miss this once-in-a-lifetime event as Harry, Ron, Hermione and all your favorite characters return to the screen and enchant the world all over …"
      }
