    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Amati String Instruments will be presented in a concert series featuring various musicians beginning in fall 2023 until spring 2024. The series has been curated by Dr. Véronique Mathieu (D.Mus), associate professor of Violin and the David L. Kaplan Chair in Music, a position made possible by a $2-million donation from USask alumni Xiaoping …"
