  {
    "@id": "https://www.saskatoonsymphony.org/temporary/4d37d585-6cab-4eea-ad90-6a38f946c3bb",
    "@type": [
      "https://schema.org/CreativeWork"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://saskatoonsymphony.org/event/sunday-chamber-2/"
      }
    ],
    "https://schema.org/text": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\t\t\t\n\n\n2:00PM, Sunday, November 19, 2023\nGrosvenor Park Church\n\n\n407 Cumberland Ave S\nSaskatoon, Saskatchewan S7H 2L3\nGoogle Maps Directions\n\n\nFREE EVENT\n\n\n\n\nThe Saskatoon Symphony Orchestra’s Chamber Ensemble is performing a free concert of music that just might make you feel some dance rhythms!\nWe had an incredible time with our free concerts at Grosvenor Park United Church last season and our Chamber Ensemble has put together another great hour of music for your Sunday afternoon.\nThis concert includes  Haydn’s String Quartet Op 74 No. 2,  Dvořák’s Bagatelles Opus 47  (arranged by Geoffrey Emerson), and some familiar melodies from The Sound of Music!\nDoors open at 1:30 pm and the concert run time is about one hour.\nThis is an in-person event only – streaming is not available for this concert.\n\n\n\n\t\t"
      }
    ]
  },
