        "@value": "Music Talk with Vincent Ho"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Join us for a very special Music Talk with renowned composer Vincent Ho. The SSO is giving the world premiere of his new concerto for saxophone and orchestra on November 25th with Grammy winner Timothy McAllister. The SSO's Mark Turner talks with Vincent and our conductor Robert Franz ahead of this special performance.\n\nThis is a …"
