        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\t\t\t\n\n\n10:00AM, Saturday, February 3, 2024\nSaskatoon Symphony Orchestra\n\n\n602 B 51st Street\nSaskatoon, Saskatchewan S7K 7K3\nGoogle Maps Directions\n\n\nFind Out More\n\n\n10:00AM, Sunday, February 4, 2024\nSaskatoon Symphony Orchestra\n\n\n602 B 51st Street\nSaskatoon, Saskatchewan S7K 7K3\nGoogle Maps Directions\n\n\nFind Out More\n\n\n\nWe’re having a pop-up Book Sale!\n \nJoin us on February 3rd and 4th for the Non-Fiction pop-up sale. Sections featured include:  History, literature, and biography.\n\n\n\t\t"
