    "https://schema.org/text": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\t\t\t\n\n\n10:00AM, Saturday, March 16, 2024\nSaskatoon Symphony Orchestra\n\n\n602 B 51st Street\nSaskatoon, Saskatchewan S7K 7K3\nGoogle Maps Directions\n\n\nFind Out More\n\n\n10:00AM, Sunday, March 17, 2024\nSaskatoon Symphony Orchestra\n\n\n602 B 51st Street\nSaskatoon, Saskatchewan S7K 7K3\nGoogle Maps Directions\n\n\nFind Out More\n\n\n\nIt’s time for another Pop-Up Sale! This one’s all about Music.\n \nSections include:\nDVDS • VINYL (WIDE SELECTION)\nCDS (CLASSICAL, POP/ROCK, COUNTRY, JAZZ ONLY)\nSHEET MUSIC (PIANO, ORGAN, COLLECTIBLE ONLY)\n\n\n\t\t"
      }
    ]
