    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Jeans ‘n Classics\n\nWhenever Jeans ‘n Classics comes to town it’s sure to be a good time. They’re joining your orchestra for an Evening of Pink Floyd, with tunes from The Wall and The Dark Side of the Moon.\n\n*Single Tickets On Sale July 2, 2024\n\n\n\nSee our full Season 94 lineup and subscribe today!\n\nFind out what's happening …"
