  {
    "@id": "https://www.saskatoonsymphony.org/temporary/cdaf89fa-3982-4653-af7e-216e77fc0ac1",
    "@type": [
      "https://schema.org/CreativeWork"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://saskatoonsymphony.org/event/the-medium/"
      }
    ],
    "https://schema.org/text": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\t\t\t\n\n\n7:30PM, Friday, January 17, 2025\nConvocation Hall\n\n\n107 Administration Place\nSaskatoon, Saskatchewan S7N 5A2\nGoogle Maps Directions\n\n\nSOLD OUT\n\n\n7:30PM, Saturday, January 18, 2025\nConvocation Hall\n\n\n107 Administration Place\nSaskatoon, Saskatchewan S7N 5A2\nGoogle Maps Directions\n\n\nWatch the Livestream\n\n\nRead The Program\n\nAnastasia WinterhaltMadame Flora (Baba)\nPaulina SalisburyMonica, daughter of Madame Flora\nMarcus MerastyToby\nAllison MooresMrs. Gobineau\nJayden BurrowsMr. Gobineau\nSanjana BrijlallMrs. Nolan\nJennifer TungMusic Director\nKerry AgnewRehearsal Pianist & Coach\nAmanda TestiniStage Director\nCatherine HuiCostume & Set Design\nShaun BzdelLighting Design\n\n\nThe MediumGian Carlo Menotti\n\n\nWhat does the future hold for you? An intimate staging of Menotti’s haunting opera The Medium starring Anastasia Winterhalt. \nIt’s a spooky two-act dramatic opera where phony psychic Madame Flora uses her clients’ grief to deceive them with the help of her daughter and a mute servant. But one night, an uncanny encounter leads to murder and madness.\n\n\n\t\t"
      }
    ]
  },
