  {
    "@id": "https://www.saskatoonsymphony.org/temporary/eb854a81-6946-4e01-a7e1-99b0bfc2e2f2",
    "@type": [
      "https://schema.org/CreativeWork"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://saskatoonsymphony.org/event/pictures-at-an-exhibition/"
      }
    ],
    "https://schema.org/text": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\t\t\t\n\n\n7:30PM, Saturday, March 29, 2025\nTCU Place, Sid Buckwold Theatre\n\n\n35 – 22nd Street East\nSaskatoon, SK S7K 0C8\nGoogle Maps Directions\n\n\nSave Your Seats\n\n\nRead The Program\n\nKarl Hirzerconductor\nMeagan Milatzpiano\n\n\nConcerto for Piano and Orchestra (David L. McIntyre\nI. Allegro moderato\nII. Largo\nIII. Allegro molto\nINTERMISSION\nPictures at an ExhibitionModest Mussorgsky and Orch. Maurice Ravel\nPromenade\nGnomus\nPromenade\nThe Old Castle\nPromenade\nTuileries\nBydło\nPromenade\nBallet of the Unhatched Chicks\nSamuel Goldenberg und Schmuÿle\nThe Market at Limoges\nCatacombs (Sepulchrum romanum – Cum mortuis in lingua mortua)\nThe Hut on Fowl’s Legs (Baba-Yagá)\nThe Great Gate of Kiev\n\n\nConductor Karl Hirzer returns to lead your SSO in Mussorgsky’s iconic Pictures at an Exhibition. Pianist Meagan Milatz makes her way back home to the prairies to help us celebrate composer David L. McIntyre’s 75th birthday with a performance of his Concerto for Piano and Orchestra (“Vickers”)\n\n\n\t\t"
      }
    ]
  },
