      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://www.saskatoonsymphony.org/temporary/980e3ee3-8eb0-49d8-965b-a37432cc9fbd",
    "@type": [
      "https://schema.org/CreativeWork"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://saskatoonsymphony.org/event/after-dark/"
      }
    ],
    "https://schema.org/text": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\t\t\t\n\n\n8:00PM, Saturday, September 14, 2024\nLouis’ Loft\n\n\nUpper Level 103 Memorial Union Building 93 Campus Drive \nSaskatoon, SK S7N 5B2\nGoogle Maps Directions\n\n\nSave Your Seats\n\n\n\nAfter Dark is back!\nThe show begins at 8 pm but mindful attendees will come as early as 7:15 to get drinks and snacks before the music starts.\nThe night features SSO musicians performing modern works paired with pub trivia. It’s a show unlike any other – it’s After Dark.\nOn the Program\nDouble Incantation – Héloïse Werner\nDark Matter – Marc Mellits\nQuintet – David Anderson\nApollo (selected movements) –  Marc Mellits\nAutumn Leaves – Elaine Fine\n\nFind out what’s happening with your Orchestra! \nSupport your orchestra by donating today!\nWhat’s Next\n\nA Change is Gonna Come7:30PM Sat, Apr 11, 2026Save Your SeatsAfter Dark8:00PM Sat, Apr 18, 2026Save Your SeatsThe Traveller7:30PM Sat, May 02, 2026Save Your SeatsJames Ehnes in Recital7:30PM Wed, May 06, 2026Save Your SeatsMothers' Day2:00PM Sun, May 10, 2026FREE EVENTFinding Light7:30PM Sat, May 30, 2026Save Your SeatsCroon8:00PM Mon, Jul 06, 2026Save Your SeatsHarry Potter and the Goblet of Fire™ in Concert1:30PM Sat, Oct 10, 2026Save Your Seats7:30PM Sat, Oct 10, 2026Save Your Seats\n\n\n\n\t\t"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://saskatoonsymphony.org/event/is-that-my-voice/",
    "http://ogp.me/ns#locale": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "en_US"
