  {
    "@id": "https://www.saskatoonsymphony.org/temporary/719d962b-7423-427f-8b82-6e0ad1957f04",
    "@type": [
      "https://schema.org/CreativeWork"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://saskatoonsymphony.org/event/sing-along-messiah-3/"
      }
    ],
    "https://schema.org/text": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\t\t\t\n\n\n2:00PM, Saturday, December 13, 2025\nKnox United Church\n\n\n838 Spadina Crescent E\nSaskatoon, SK S7K 3H4\nGoogle Maps Directions\n\n\nSave Your Seats\n\n\nRead The Program\n\nKarl Hirzerconductor\nCasey Pedensoprano\nAndrea Ludwigmezzo-soprano\nSpencer McKnighttenor\nJayden Burrowsbass\nSSO Chorus\n\n\nMessiahGeorge Frideric Handel\n\n\nIt’s the return of Sing-Along Messiah! Want to learn more? Visit our Sing-Along FAQs.\nWith an all-Saskatchewan line of soloists and the SSO Chorus, we continue our favourite tradition where you get to join in the chorus.\nSing-Along Messiah is dedicated to the memory of longtime SSO chorus member and friend, Kathleen Brannen. \n\n\n\t\t"
      }
    ]
  },
