    "https://schema.org/text": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\t\t\t\n\n\n7:30PM, Saturday, December 6, 2025\nTCU Place, Sid Buckwold Theatre\n\n\n35 – 22nd Street East\nSaskatoon, SK S7K 0C8\nGoogle Maps Directions\n\n\nSave Your Seats\n\n\nRead The Program\n\nJanna Sailorconductor\nAlex Brownhost\nand the YXE Divas\nBetty Allison\nFalynn Baptiste\nElyse Evangelista\nEileen Laverty\nEllen Nasser\nSonia Reid\nJessica Robinson\nwith surprise guests!\n\n\nHaul out the holly! After our first electrifying YXE Divas show in 2024, we’re bursting with holiday cheer to bring the divas back for a night of pure festive joy!\nMaestra Janna Sailor and the Divas have all your favourite holiday hits, while the SSO won’t let you miss out on the seasonal classics.\nAdd this show to your subscription package and save!\n\n\n\t\t"
      }
    ]
  },
