    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://saskatoonsymphony.org/event/the-space-between/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Space Between"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Multi-Grammy winner, Dame Evelyn Glennie is the centrepiece of a night of mystical story telling with Ho’s From Darkness to Light and we bring light to the darkness with Shostakovich’s 5th Symphony."
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/eventStatus": [
      {
        "@id": "http://schema.org/EventScheduled"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://www.saskatoonsymphony.org/temporary/7e4c29bd-cf85-4835-81a7-626b20a06cd3",
    "@type": [
      "https://schema.org/Blog"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://saskatoonsymphony.org/event/the-space-between/"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://www.saskatoonsymphony.org/temporary/ef3d6591-bd0a-451a-8f1a-235565ce4a1f",
    "@type": [
      "https://schema.org/WPHeader"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://saskatoonsymphony.org/event/the-space-between/"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://www.saskatoonsymphony.org/temporary/37881016-3db3-4f5b-b615-4fdba5371369",
    "@type": [
      "https://schema.org/CreativeWork"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://saskatoonsymphony.org/event/the-space-between/"
      }
    ],
    "https://schema.org/text": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\t\t\t\n\n\n7:30PM, Saturday, October 25, 2025\nTCU Place, Sid Buckwold Theatre\n\n\n35 – 22nd Street East\nSaskatoon, SK S7K 0C8\nGoogle Maps Directions\n\n\nSave Your Seats\n\n\nRead The Program\n\nKarl Hirzerconductor\nDame Evelyn Glenniepercussion\n\n\nFrom Darkness to LightVincent Ho*\nSymphony No 5 in D Minor, Op 47Dimitri Shostakovich\n\n\nA landmark night for the SSO as we’re joined by Maestro Karl Hirzer and superstar percussion Dame Evelyn Glennie.\nMulti-Grammy award winner, Glennie is one of the most sensational artists we’ve ever shared the stage with – the centrepiece of a night of mystical story telling when she performs Vincent Ho’s From Darkness to Light.\nKarl continues the theme bringing light to the darkness with Shostakovich’s towering 5th Symphony. An orchestral journey towards the light, the work stands as a testament to Shostakovich’s defiance in the face of political oppression.\n*Denotes Canadian composer.\nAdd this show to your subscription package and save!\n\n\n\t\t"
      }
    ]
  },
