      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\t\t\t\n\n\n8:00PM, Wednesday, July 9, 2025\nThe Broadway Theatre\n\n\n715 Broadway Ave\nSaskatoon, SK S7N 1B3\nGoogle Maps Directions\n\n\nGet Tickets\n\n\nRead The Program\n\nParis on the Prairies sees the Saskatoon Jazz Orchestra and Saskatoon Symphony Orchestra joining forces at the SaskTel Saskatchewan Jazz Festival for a musical adventure to Paris. Featuring the brilliant multi Juno award winning composer/pianist David Braid and the evocative vocals styles of Saskatoon’s own Alexis Normand, this concert is guaranteed to transport you to the romance and charm of Paris — all right here on the prairies!\nSaskatoon Jazz Orchestra: https://saskatoonjazzorchestra.com/\nSaskatoon Symphony Orchestra: https://saskatoonsymphony.org/\nFor more information on the special guests please visit:\nhttp://www.davidbraid.com/\nhttps://alexisnormand.com/\nThis show is part of the ticketed program at The Broadway Theatre.\n\n\n\t\t"
      }
    ]
  },
