        "@value": "\n\t\t\t\n\n\n2:00PM, Sunday, June 1, 2025\nSt John’s Cathedral\n\n\n 816 Spadina Crescent E\nSaskatoon, Saskatchewan S7K 3H4\nGoogle Maps Directions\n\n\nFREE EVENT\n\n\n\nArtist Monique Martin is on site to talk about her process of creating the thousands of paper butterflies, and the incredible floor cloth featuring a forest floor.\n\n\n\t\t"
