    "https://schema.org/text": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\t\t\t\n\n\n2:00PM, Sunday, June 1, 2025\nSt John’s Cathedral\n\n\n 816 Spadina Crescent E\nSaskatoon, Saskatchewan S7K 3H4\nGoogle Maps Directions\n\n\nFind Out More\n\n\n6:00PM, Wednesday, June 4, 2025\nSt John’s Cathedral\n\n\n 816 Spadina Crescent E\nSaskatoon, Saskatchewan S7K 3H4\nGoogle Maps Directions\n\n\nFind Out More\n\n\n4:00PM, Friday, June 6, 2025\nSt John’s Cathedral\n\n\n 816 Spadina Crescent E\nSaskatoon, Saskatchewan S7K 3H4\nGoogle Maps Directions\n\n\nFind Out More\n\n\n4:00PM, Saturday, June 7, 2025\nSt John’s Cathedral\n\n\n 816 Spadina Crescent E\nSaskatoon, Saskatchewan S7K 3H4\nGoogle Maps Directions\n\n\nFind Out More\n\n\n2:00PM, Sunday, June 8, 2025\nSt John’s Cathedral\n\n\n 816 Spadina Crescent E\nSaskatoon, Saskatchewan S7K 3H4\nGoogle Maps Directions\n\n\nFind Out More\n\n\n\nCome see the installation up close!\nThese come-and-go events are free to attend. Please remove your shoes before walking on the artwork.\nFull Schedule Of Public Viewings:\nSunday, June 1 – 2:00 pm – 9:00 pm\nWednesday, June 4 – 6:00 pm – 9:00 pm\nFriday, June 6 – 4:00 pm – 9:00 pm\nSaturday, June 7 – 4:00 pm – 9:00 pm\nSunday, June 8 – 2:00 pm – 9:00 pm\n\n\n\t\t"
      }
    ]
  },
