    "https://schema.org/text": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\t\t\t\n\n\n7:00PM, Tuesday, June 3, 2025\nSt John’s Cathedral\n\n\n 816 Spadina Crescent E\nSaskatoon, Saskatchewan S7K 3H4\nGoogle Maps Directions\n\n\nFREE EVENT\n\n\n\nA performance by North Park Wilson School Band, Creative Action Students (grade 8) and Free Flow Dance.\nNorth Park Wilson- Creative Action Students (Grade 8) Choreographed by Sheryl Salen music Echorus by Phillip Glass Costumes by Monique Martin and students. Silkscreened images created by the students make up part of the costumes.\nFree Flow Dance Theatre, Butterfly performed by Quinlan Sharkey Choreographed by Jackie Latendress music is “Someday” arranged by Anne Beckolay, costume butterflies created by Monique Martin\n\n\n\t\t"
      }
    ]
  },
