        "@id": "https://saskatoonsymphony.org/event/butterfly-piano-recital/"
      }
    ],
    "https://schema.org/text": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\t\t\t\n\n\n7:30PM, Thursday, June 5, 2025\nSt John’s Cathedral\n\n\n 816 Spadina Crescent E\nSaskatoon, Saskatchewan S7K 3H4\nGoogle Maps Directions\n\n\nGet Tickets\n\n\n\nPiano recital with Sofia Mycyk featuring Papillons by Schumann, Butterfly étude by Chopin, Die Schmetterling by Grieg, Butterflies and Bobcats by SK’s own David McIntyre, Changes by Alexina Louie and the enchanting Metamorphosis by Philip Glass.\n \n\n\n\t\t"
      }
    ]
  },
