        "@id": "https://saskatoonsymphony.org/event/christmas-classics-at-the-cathedral-2025/"
      }
    ],
    "https://schema.org/text": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\t\t\t\n\n\n7:30PM, Sunday, December 21, 2025\nSt John’s Cathedral\n\n\n 816 Spadina Crescent E\nSaskatoon, Saskatchewan S7K 3H4\nGoogle Maps Directions\n\n\nSOLD OUT\n\n\nRead The Program\n\nChelsea Mahan JeansonNarrator\nSaskatoon Symphony Chamber Ensemble\n\n\nChristmas music is our favourite here at the SSO, which is why we wanted to bring you this special concert on December 21st.\nAll your favourite classical Christmas music, a classic sing-along, and the joys of Christmas with the ones you love and your SSO.\n\n\n\t\t"
      }
    ]
  },
