      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\t\t\t\n\n\n6:00PM, Wednesday, July 30, 2025\nBlack Fox\n\n\nComp 117 Site, 245 Valley Road, 319 RR3\nSaskatoon, SK S7K 3J6\nGoogle Maps Directions\n\n\nSOLD OUT – THIS EVENT IS AT CAPACITY\n\n\n\nJanna Sailorconductor\nKateryna Khartovasoprano\nSpencer McKnighttenor\n\n\nOn July 30th, Black Fox Farm transforms into a natural amphitheater where your SSO will perform Italian love songs against the backdrop of the stunning Black Fox Farm.\nWhat to Expect:\n\nAn exclusive performance by the SSO featuring soprano Kateryna Khartova, and tenor Spencer McKnight\nCraft cocktails featuring a special Black Fox gin release created for this event\nBeautiful floral installations throughout the grounds\nNatural hillside seating with stunning prairie views—guests may bring chairs or blankets to enjoy the evening\nDJ and dancing as the stars emerge\n\n\n\n\t\t"
      }
    ]
  },
