    ],
    "https://schema.org/text": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\t\t\t\n\n\n2:00PM, Sunday, November 16, 2025\nGrosvenor Park Church\n\n\n407 Cumberland Ave S\nSaskatoon, Saskatchewan S7H 2L3\nGoogle Maps Directions\n\n\nFREE EVENT\n\n\n\nSofia MycykPiano\nSaskatoon Symphony Chamber Musicians\n\n\nClarinet Sonata in E-flat Major, Op. 120, No. 2 — I. Allegro amabileJohannes Brahms\nLike doves with grey wings embracingAnna Pidgorna\nFound Objects: On the Beach (selections)Jenni Brandon\nSuite de trois morceaux, Op.116 — III. ValseBenjamin Godard\nPiano Quintet in A Major, Op. 114, D. 667 (“Trout”) — IV. Tema con variazione. AndantinoFranz Schubert\n\n\nSpend a Sunday afternoon at a concert featuring the SSO Chamber Ensemble! Whether you are bringing your family, your friends, or just looking to enjoy beautiful music, this concert is a delightful way to spend an hour on Sunday, November 16th.\n\n\nThis is a free event.\n\n \n\n\n\n\t\t"
      }
    ]
  },
