    "https://schema.org/text": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\t\t\t\n\n\n10:00AM, Friday, January 30, 2026\nNutrien Wonderhub\n\n\n950 Spadina Crescent E\nSaskatoon, SK S7K 3H6\nGoogle Maps Directions\n\n\nSOLD OUT\n\n\n11:15AM, Friday, January 30, 2026\nNutrien Wonderhub\n\n\n950 Spadina Crescent E\nSaskatoon, SK S7K 3H6\nGoogle Maps Directions\n\n\nRegister\n\n\n10:00AM, Saturday, January 31, 2026\nNutrien Wonderhub\n\n\n950 Spadina Crescent E\nSaskatoon, SK S7K 3H6\nGoogle Maps Directions\n\n\nSOLD OUT\n\n\n11:15AM, Saturday, January 31, 2026\nNutrien Wonderhub\n\n\n950 Spadina Crescent E\nSaskatoon, SK S7K 3H6\nGoogle Maps Directions\n\n\nSOLD OUT\n\n\n\nWe see colours all around us. Did you know you can hear colours too? Explore colours with the music and instruments of the Saskatoon Symphony Core Musicians. We’ll sing, dance and play!\nSpecifically designed for your mini-maestro, these parent and child experiences are perfect for your 2- to 4-year-old music lover.\nExplore music through movement, song and dance with SSO musicians. Let the music connect you and your child and send you both on a journey through melody, rhythm, colour, and beautiful sound.\n\n\n\t\t"
      }
    ]
  },
