    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Some days you just need to think outside the box. That's where all the music comes from for this After Dark!\n\nWhat is After Dark? It's a night of good food and drinks with friends, pub trivia, and unusual and experimental music played by musicians from your orchestra.\n\nIt's the show series that inspired our After Dark …"
