    "https://schema.org/text": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\t\t\t\n\n\n8:00PM, Saturday, April 18, 2026\nLouis’ Loft\n\n\nUpper Level 103 Memorial Union Building 93 Campus Drive \nSaskatoon, SK S7N 5B2\nGoogle Maps Directions\n\n\nSave Your Seats\n\n\n\nSome days you just need to think outside the box. That’s where all the music comes from for this After Dark!\nWhat is After Dark? It’s a night of good food and drinks with friends, pub trivia, and unusual and experimental music played by musicians from your orchestra.\nIt’s the show series that inspired our After Dark Gin!\n\n\n\t\t"
      }
    ]
  },
